    - id: 35c612e074301fae34ac6ab4429fc51b
      blockGroup: 400064b1d80633af82b7913a790702ce
      sortingKey: a000
      type: markdown
      content: |-
        # Revenue metrics

        The semantic layer for revenue: **one definition per metric**, exported as functions so every
        notebook, app and AI agent computes ARR, NRR, GRR and pipeline coverage the same way. Each function
        is self-contained (imports inside, no shared globals) because exported functions run in the
        importing notebook.

        - **ARR** is 12 × month-end MRR.
        - **NRR** (trailing twelve months): ARR today from the accounts that paid twelve months ago,
          divided by their ARR then.
        - **GRR**: the same cohort with each account capped at its starting ARR, so expansion can't hide
          churn and contraction.
        - **Pipeline coverage**: open pipeline at the start of a quarter ÷ that quarter's new-business target.
      metadata: {}
    - id: 09c76361e22f4261145e091a8d64a96c
      blockGroup: 759729db20e8660fb900152c14ea49d0
      sortingKey: a001
      type: code
      content: |-
        def arr_movements(mrr, region="All", segment="All"):
            """ARR movements per quarter, in USD.

            ARR is 12 x month-end MRR. Each account's month-over-month ARR change is classified as
            new (first revenue), expansion (up), contraction (down, still paying) or churn (to zero),
            and the monthly changes are summed per quarter.
            """
            import pandas as pd

            df = mrr
            if region != "All":
                df = df[df["region"] == region]
            if segment != "All":
                df = df[df["segment"] == segment]
            arr = df.pivot_table(index="account_id", columns="month", values="mrr", aggfunc="sum", fill_value=0.0) * 12
            arr = arr.reindex(columns=sorted(mrr["month"].unique()), fill_value=0.0)
            prev = arr.shift(1, axis=1).fillna(0.0)
            paid_before = arr.cummax(axis=1).shift(1, axis=1).fillna(0.0) > 0
            delta = (arr - prev).iloc[:, 1:]
            kinds = {
                "New": (~paid_before & (arr > 0)).iloc[:, 1:],
                "Expansion": ((prev > 0) & (arr > 0)).iloc[:, 1:] & (delta > 0),
                "Contraction": ((prev > 0) & (arr > 0)).iloc[:, 1:] & (delta < 0),
                "Churn": ((prev > 0) & (arr == 0)).iloc[:, 1:],
            }
            rows = []
            for kind, mask in kinds.items():
                monthly = delta.where(mask, 0.0).sum(axis=0)
                quarterly = monthly.groupby(pd.PeriodIndex(monthly.index, freq="Q")).sum()
                for q, value in quarterly.items():
                    rows.append({"quarter": f"{q.year}-Q{q.quarter}", "movement": kind, "arr_change": round(float(value), 2)})
            return pd.DataFrame(rows)


        arr_movements
      metadata:
        function_export_name: arr_movements
    - id: ea55c8302fa15288461ad15af281be3e
